@startuml anemic-architecture
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title When two copies disagree
caption Hypothetical extension defect — not baseline behavior
rectangle "Sale caller" as S
rectangle "Eligibility query" as Q
rectangle "Predicate A\nsettled AND unreserved\nAND remaining > 0" as A #E4F3EF
rectangle "Predicate B\nsettled only" as B #FFF3D9
rectangle "Same settled, reserved lot\n10 remaining shares" as D
S -down-> A
Q -down-> B
A -down-> D : rejects
B -down-> D : incorrectly accepts
note bottom of D
 Duplication can occur in either model.
 Centralize the policy and test both callers.
end note
@enduml
